            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ntāngāriza aho nyene kur’ urwo ruzi Ahava ivyo kwisonzesha, kugira ngo twicishe bugufi imbere y’Imana yacu, ngo tuyisabe iduhe kugira urugendo rwiza, twebge n’abana bacu n’ ibintu vyacu vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 15:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko vyanteye isoni gusaba umwami umuce w’ingabo n’abagendera ku mafarasi, ngo baze badutabare kwivuna abansi bodutegera mu nzira; kuko twari twabgiye umwami, tut’ Ikiganza c’Imana yacu kiri ku bayitwaririka bose, ngw ibagirire neza; arik’ ububasha bgayo n’uburake birwanya abayireka bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
