              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ku musi ugira icumi na kabiri w’ukwezi kwa mbere turahaguruka tuva kur’ urwo ruzi Ahava, ngo tuje i Yerusalemu; ikiganza c’Imana yacu kiba kuri twebge, iradukiza ngo ntitugwe mu maboko y’abansi n’abaturyamiye mu mayira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dushitse i Yerusalemu turuhuka imisi itatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NEH.11.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Neh 11:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze ku musi ugira kane bagera ku munzane ayo mafeza n’ amazahabu n’ibindi bintu, babigerera mu ngoro y’Imana yacu, babishikiriza Meremoti mwene Uriya umuherezi, ari kumwe na Eleyazari mwene Finehasi, kandi bari bafatanije na Yozabadi mwene Yosuwa na Nowadiya mwene Binuwi, b’Abalewi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vyose barabiharūra ukw igitigiri cavyo n’ukuriba kwavyo vyangana. Ico gihe nyene ukuriba kwavyo kwose kurandikwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
